  "description": "Read-method arguments (uid TEST123) to the endpoint and the exact request body, or {\"error\": \"RequestValidationError\", \"fields\": [...]} (wire keys, see order_validation.json) when the arguments are rejected before anything is sent. input.call names the client method, input.arguments its parameters; a time argument is {\"datetime\": ISO 8601} (an offset is required), {\"date\": YYYY-MM-DD} (00:00 IST) or an integer of epoch seconds; a float or text time is rejected. Ids and tokens must be strings (an integer is rejected, never converted). OrderBook sends uid only; EODChartData sends sym = EXCH:TSYM, from, to and no uid; optional TPSeries keys (st, et, intrv) are omitted when not given. GetPendingGTTOrder and GetEnabledGTTs send uid only; GetTrgOi sends uid and actid.",
  "source": "tradesmart.TradeSmart read methods (request captured by an in-memory transport)",
  "tolerance": {}
